msgid "**Name**: ``Rfam_get_tree_data``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/rfam_tools.rst:257 0362aa7b719d4941ad9df6777408fa7a
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get phylogenetic tree for RNA family in NHX format (New "
"Hampshire eXtended). Returns tree structure based on seed alignment "
"showing evolutionary relationships. Tree includes species names and "
"sequence information. Can be visualized with tree viewers (FigTree, iTOL,"
" ETE). Use for: phylogenetic analysis, understanding RNA family "
"evolution, species distribution analysis, taxonomic studies. NHX format "
"includes extended annotations beyond standard Newick."
msgstr ""

